Photorealistic industrial user-interface asset: one single wide horizontal push button plate, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, spanning 88 percent of the image width and about one quarter of its height, isolated on a pure flat black background. Shape: long heavy bar with slightly rounded corners, like a control on foundry machinery. Frame: thick forged dark steel bezel, worn and bead-blasted, with one hex bolt at the far left end and one at the far right end. A thin seam of molten orange light glows just inside the bezel all the way around, like hot metal. Face: completely blank matte black powder-coated steel with faint fine scratches. Heavy, raw, engineered. Product photography, crisp focus, symmetrical. Absolutely no text, no letters, no symbols, no icons, no warning stripes. One object only, no watermark.
